{
  "name": "P02 | Sales Pipeline & Approvals - Final",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## P02 | Sales Pipeline & Approvals\n**Intake:** `OpportunityInput` receives `quote_id`, `lead_id`, and other proposal fields from `P02 | Sales Proposal & Quotation` output.\n**Manual Demo Test:** preview only (NO database writes).\n**Human Approval:** `ReviewProposalForm` is restricted to logged-in n8n users with execution permission. It looks up `P02_Proposals` and `P02_Opportunities` before writing any decision.\n**Data Tables:** P02_Opportunities, P02_ApprovalLog; reads/writes existing P02_Proposals.\n**On approved decision:** `ApprovedDocumentHandoff` is the point to connect Execute Sub-workflow for Module 05. **No auto-approval, auto-email, or payment.** Reviewer must confirm the pricing and scope. Publish only after testing and access review.",
        "height": 410,
        "width": 670
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -336,
        288
      ],
      "id": "4b9c3313-4234-49e2-837b-790536c7aade",
      "name": "04 | Read Me"
    },
